{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\"issues\":[{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"心里悬了很久的期待，到这里终于先得到了满足\",\"source\":\"若还记得第32小节那次差一点抵达、却没能真正落定的高潮，这里又可以听出另一层：前面悬置已久的期待，终于得到了某种满足。\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿将其作为一种可选择的听法，并用“某种”限定满足感，屏幕稿则将其写成了确定得到满足。\"},{\"sec\":\"S11\",\"screen\":\"陈设没变\",\"source\":\"家具可能没变\",\"type\":2,\"severity\":\"轻微\",\"why\":\"定稿对旧屋陈设是否改变保留了可能性，屏幕稿改成确定没有变化。\"}]}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "3412b658-cc84-43de-a0f1-5882f9bcb117", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T035709096684Z", "elapsed_seconds": 282.812, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T04:01:51.904619+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "824927068d293d776f6bf44e7ca3ed3a800b29838b5b7c09110cf17996b6196f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a737073